// IntroString :
"P398390491" "The police dispatcher has just received a signal from the silent alarm at Diane's Diamonds in Founders Falls. In a daring daylight attack, Arachnos troops have struck the building and taken the people inside hostage. It seems unlikely that they've come for mere theft, but their hostages are in no less danger. Those brutal butchers from the Rogue Isles won't care who gets hurt, and the police may not be able to handle them. This looks like a job for a hero."
// AcceptString :
"P2858267095" "Stop the robbery at Diane's Diamonds in Founders Falls"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
